      "id": "2026-11-13-fixed-toolbar-label-shortcuts-user-s-4662f3a3",
      "kind": "fix",
      "summary": "Show the shortcut of the plugin the button toggles, so a rebound shortcut shows its new keys. After mount, the tooltip shows it as `⇧⌘X` on Apple devices and `Ctrl+Shift+X` elsewhere, and the button sets `aria-keyshortcuts`. A disabled button shows no shortcut.",
